From 8fce50b38082ed9164a0379bb4786d3a2cf079c6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 00:09:39 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] profiling(iket): sample runtime while loops and classify
 network and gather phases

Upstream base: local-inference-lab/vllm 19f2c20ed4d64ae22bd009ceacadd85e2a81e354.
Immediate base: 0743-Project-CED-global-KV-on-local-rows-before-gathering.patch.

Give generated CUDA while loops a synthetic trip counter when loop-iteration sampling is active so persistent and unknown-trip loops record bounded initial trips without changing their loop condition, while preserving sampled global flag spin loops as wait.spin phases. Recognize SparkNet staging, doorbell variants, and exchange pack intrinsics as distinct store.stage, signal.proxy, and load.gather phases, and classify vllm_gather_b128 as store.global so gather_columns_into coalesces with its scalar tail branch into a single 2-event store.global range. Vision TMA-only and multi-warp TMA producer synchronization is handled natively by TileLang producer_consumer_ws.cc.

Quality: profiling-only source postprocessor; inactive unless VLLM_DS41_IKET is set.

Tests: 17 CPU phase tests and GPU kernel manifest/producer synchronization checks pass across two GPU boots.
Upstream status: local candidate, not yet submitted.
